  uploadHelp: ["JPG, PNG, atau WebP, maksimal 10 MB dan 24 megapiksel. Salinan JPEG maksimal 1024 piksel disimpan di browser hanya setelah Simpan catatan; tidak dikirim ke server atau otomatis menjadi data training.", "JPG, PNG, or WebP, up to 10 MB and 24 megapixels. A JPEG copy up to 1024 pixels is saved in this browser only after Save record; it is not sent to a server or automatically added to training."],
